Z||000010||ferrari_momo||09-04-2001||12:47 AM||||Josh,<BR>  yes, it is functional.  you must cut a hole in the center.  the air vents out from the scoop by the windshild.  i replied to your email, Josh.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  thanks for the order.  <BR>  on fire, nice color.  yes, that looks like the same hood scoop i make  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  i just name it ZR1, hehehe..  <A HREF="http://www.thefibersmith.com" TARGET=_blank>www.thefibersmith.com</A> <BR>price subject to change w/o notice.  but i will not go crazy on raising the price.  thefibersmith wants you to be your most favorite place to shop. <BR>sincerely yours,<BR>pat k.<BR><P>------------------<BR>||||reg||10
